sangati abhava

  -- abhava: absence — the knowable non-existence.
  -- four kinds: pragabhava (prior), pradhvamsabhava (posterior),
  --   atyantabhava (absolute), anyonyabhava (mutual).
  -- "no match" IS abhava — the graph's acknowledgment that something is not found.
  -- pratishedha (negation) is the linguistic expression of abhava.

  "padartha-amsha"
  "brahman-sthalam-sthita"
  "sthiti-abheda shunya-rahita"
  "tirodhana-yukta viraam-yukta"
  "pratishedha-abheda"

done
